{"title":"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> be an acute triangle such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/d/e5d9ab1115f581d4e52ad1477e8098917ce3745d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB\\neq AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> ,with circumcircle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> and circumcenter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be a point on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/5/505a4c0b3451b2047cd5be3984e667d59a642f72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD \\perp  BC$\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />. let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be a point such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a026cd0e6d0aad8fb5102a166f30601e77c20373.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BDCT$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a parallelogram  and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> a point on the same side of  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/8/998e30a362e529aeb65f070f2590b679aeee67a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{BQM}=\\angle{BCA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"141\" height=\"16\" /> and  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e8d688040e7686e58855f3300c6750e642e3b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{CQM}=\\angle{CBA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" />. Let the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c53cc93aa43cc55bea0dc2511833fe6bdda020f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AO$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4b7b3a4d1cba5be2e64a8c73489e958ba60d84c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(E\\neq A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> and let the circumcircle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/d/fed09691b7ac998a60c1c3fe2824f6dd2f84051c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ETQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"17\" />  intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> at point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a57861894f8364baeed8bf3a732638fafe0edc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X\\neq E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />. Prove that the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3ed201be08eedf3a35c18c7aa50006ef8e737e53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> are collinear .\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO\" title=\"2017 JBMO\">2017 JBMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13_contests\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 JBMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\"> All JBMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018003914\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPrepr